00:27:04.303 --> 00:27:06.248
If you have any complaints, please come to us directly.

517
00:27:06.315 --> 00:27:07.750
Don't bother people around you

518
00:27:07.817 --> 00:27:09.241
Well then, that's it
[Shinwon’s embarrassed exclamation]

519
00:27:09.308 --> 00:27:10.886
Wait a minute, I have something to say too.

520
00:27:10.953 --> 00:27:11.879
What is it?

521
00:27:11.946 --> 00:27:13.446
(Shinwon) Well, that’s over there...

522
00:27:14.015 --> 00:27:16.849
Under Ban, Ban Joo-yeon, General Manager
Are you going to stay?

523
00:27:17.752 --> 00:27:19.100
Why are you curious about that?

524
00:27:19.167 --> 00:27:20.629
[Shinwon’s embarrassed groan]
Are you going to kick me out?

525
00:27:20.696 --> 00:27:22.565
No, no, that can't be possible.

526
00:27:22.632 --> 00:27:25.292
Well, uh, I mean...

527
00:27:25.359 --> 00:27:27.136
(Shinwon) Uh, that means that I...

528
00:27:27.203 --> 00:27:28.995
What, what was he trying to say...

529
00:27:29.834 --> 00:27:31.066
[Sujeong’s frustrated sigh]

530
00:27:31.133 --> 00:27:32.365
Oh, please come in.

531
00:27:36.968 --> 00:27:38.371
[Door bell sounds]
[Sound of door opening and closing]

532
00:27:40.968 --> 00:27:42.871
[Interesting music]

533
00:27:44.846 --> 00:27:45.809
[sigh]

534
00:27:53.953 --> 00:27:54.822
no

535
00:27:55.756 --> 00:27:57.658
There's no way you can't see people like that.

536
00:28:00.567 --> 00:28:02.495
[Sparkling sound effect]
[Soft music]

537
00:28:05.064 --> 00:28:07.467
[Sparkling sound effect]

538
00:28:11.639 --> 00:28:13.437
[Sparkling sound effect]

539
00:28:16.385 --> 00:28:17.844
(Juyeon) Oh, no!
[Exciting music]

540
00:28:23.901 --> 00:28:24.917
[Sound of door closing]

541
00:28:25.834 --> 00:28:27.834
[Doorbell sounds]

542
00:28:29.156 --> 00:28:31.125
(Wonseop) Ah, who else is there tonight...

543
00:28:31.192 --> 00:28:32.560
(Sujeong) Okay, Dad, sit down.

544
00:28:34.767 --> 00:28:36.400
[Tense sound effect]

545
00:28:36.467 --> 00:28:38.831
[Exciting music]

546
00:28:41.102 --> 00:28:44.004
(Edited) What kind of contract is this again?
Isn’t there something to write about?

547
00:28:44.071 --> 00:28:46.167
It's not like that.

548
00:28:46.234 --> 00:28:47.140
(Edited) Ah...

549
00:28:47.683 --> 00:28:48.943
Eat it first

550
00:28:49.010 --> 00:28:51.220
Eggs again today
It must be very tasty.

551
00:28:51.287 --> 00:28:52.555
I'm still in the evening

552
00:28:55.816 --> 00:28:58.786
(Juyeon) Instead, Baek Soo-jeong’s life
I'm here to give you some important advice.

553
00:29:01.463 --> 00:29:02.423
My life?

554
00:29:02.490 --> 00:29:04.967
Of course, construction classification is important.

555
00:29:05.034 --> 00:29:08.360
(Juyeon) But the life of a subordinate
Just watching you fall into the abyss

556
00:29:08.427 --> 00:29:10.231
I don't think it's my boss's duty.

557
00:29:12.528 --> 00:29:13.399
Yes?

558
00:29:13.968 --> 00:29:15.968
[humorous music]

559
00:29:17.271 --> 00:29:18.271
(Juyeon) Read it

560
00:29:20.733 --> 00:29:23.910
Are you here to recommend comic books?

561
00:29:25.146 --> 00:29:28.089
(Edited) No matter how much, not me
I know there's no one to talk to like this, but

562
00:29:28.156 --> 00:29:29.183
(Juyeon) There

563
00:29:29.250 --> 00:29:30.182
If you look there

564
00:29:30.249 --> 00:29:31.752
Why you shouldn't fall for a playboy

565
00:29:31.819 --> 00:29:33.187
Well explained

566
00:29:33.254 --> 00:29:35.289
I heard that my first love was also scammed by a scammer.

567
00:29:35.356 --> 00:29:37.256
To the playboy
It can't happen again, can it?

568
00:29:38.993 --> 00:29:40.161
What is that all of a sudden...

569
00:29:40.228 --> 00:29:42.398
To Director Shinwon Kim
Something I'm rationally interested in

570
00:29:43.264 --> 00:29:44.230
I know everything

571
00:29:46.000 --> 00:29:46.933
Me?

572
00:29:48.872 --> 00:29:49.806
Isn't it?

573
00:29:49.873 --> 00:29:50.803
It's not

574
00:29:51.947 --> 00:29:52.939
Then why

575
00:29:53.474 --> 00:29:55.374
Did you meet separately at a cafe after work?

576
00:29:57.319 --> 00:29:58.377
How did you know?

577
00:29:59.981 --> 00:30:02.383
I happened to pass by and saw it

578
00:30:02.450 --> 00:30:04.685
- (Edited) Ah...
- (Juyeon) I’m disappointed.

579
00:30:04.752 --> 00:30:07.889
Even Baek Soo-jeong fell in love with that human charm.
I didn't know I was deluded

580
00:30:09.965 --> 00:30:13.559
Smile and be kind
That kind of charm with good manners?

581
00:30:15.730 --> 00:30:17.098
Soo-jeong Baek is like that too.

582
00:30:19.467 --> 00:30:20.402
Is it good?

583
00:30:21.802 --> 00:30:23.470
No, I don't like that.

584
00:30:24.772 --> 00:30:28.150
(Edit) Wouldn’t it be better to just do that to me?
A bit clumsy and clumsy

585
00:30:31.520 --> 00:30:32.580
I guess so.

586
00:30:32.647 --> 00:30:33.980
Because love is unique

587
00:30:35.316 --> 00:30:36.692
Then, I am interested in Director Kim Shin-won...

588
00:30:36.759 --> 00:30:38.786
No, I'm not interested

589
00:30:38.853 --> 00:30:41.280
They said they were investigating my background.
I met you to argue.

590
00:30:41.989 --> 00:30:43.222
[Interesting music]
Background investigation?

591
00:30:43.289 --> 00:30:46.076
[Sighing] Here and there
Looks like he was trying to find out my weakness.

592
00:30:49.931 --> 00:30:50.820
(Juyeon) Ah...

593
00:30:59.501 --> 00:31:00.461
[Slight moan]

594
00:31:07.934 --> 00:31:08.981
[sigh]

595
00:31:11.334 --> 00:31:12.219
[sigh]

596
00:31:12.286 --> 00:31:14.086
Oishi, no

597
00:31:15.323 --> 00:31:16.389
It's delicious

598
00:31:17.300 --> 00:31:18.233
[Juyeon sighs]

599
00:31:18.300 --> 00:31:19.458
(Juyeon) Who am I?

600
00:31:21.737 --> 00:31:22.795
Let's eat

601
00:31:30.705 --> 00:31:31.708
[Sound of car door opening]

602
00:31:33.501 --> 00:31:34.540
[Sound of car door closing]

603
00:31:39.547 --> 00:31:42.116
(Edited) Anyway, I'll have fun reading it

604
00:31:42.183 --> 00:31:44.052
I don't have any chance of being bullied by a cheater.

605
00:31:44.593 --> 00:31:46.220
It was rude late at night.

606
00:31:46.287 --> 00:31:48.089
Please tell your father I'm sorry too.

607
00:31:49.190 --> 00:31:50.214
yes

608
00:31:53.102 --> 00:31:54.126
(Edited) But

609
00:31:54.929 --> 00:31:56.730
I told Director Kim Shin-won

610
00:31:56.797 --> 00:31:59.574
What were you going to do if you were really interested?

611
00:31:59.641 --> 00:32:01.500
If you say it doesn't matter if you're a flirt,

612
00:32:02.236 --> 00:32:03.203
that interest

613
00:32:03.738 --> 00:32:05.638
I have to keep ripping it off until it disappears.

614
00:32:07.875 --> 00:32:08.867
Why?

615
00:32:09.844 --> 00:32:12.246
Because of his duty as a boss?

616
00:32:12.880 --> 00:32:13.846
(Juyeon) Just

617
00:32:15.349 --> 00:32:16.316
Because I don't like it

618
00:32:17.868 --> 00:32:19.868
[Calm music]

619
00:32:29.925 --> 00:32:30.963
Then let's go

620
00:32:47.222 --> 00:32:48.147
(Subin) Sister

621
00:32:48.749 --> 00:32:49.850
Who are you just now?

622
00:32:51.660 --> 00:32:52.818
You don’t have to know, Mr...

623
00:32:57.425 --> 00:33:00.793
[Interesting music]
(Subin) Isn’t 6,000 won cheap?

624
00:33:01.360 --> 00:33:03.620
But now department stores will sell comics too?

625
00:33:03.687 --> 00:33:05.398
Oh, not that.

626
00:33:06.434 --> 00:33:07.433
(Wonseop) Hey, hey, hey

627
00:33:08.569 --> 00:33:10.371
If it's not like that, then what?

628
00:33:10.438 --> 00:33:12.773
Why did he come to my house again, huh?

629
00:33:12.840 --> 00:33:14.809
No matter how much of a core talent you are,

630
00:33:14.876 --> 00:33:17.044
Even paying my hospitalization fee wasn’t enough, huh?

631
00:33:17.111 --> 00:33:20.381
This keeps coming up late at night
Well, I guess

632
00:33:20.448 --> 00:33:21.514
[clears cough awkwardly]

633
00:33:23.417 --> 00:33:26.220
The general manager told you
You don’t have any other intentions, right?

634
00:33:26.287 --> 00:33:28.421
[Soobin bursts out laughing]

635
00:33:29.688 --> 00:33:32.782
(Subin) Dad, I really heard it recently.
The funniest of all gags

636
00:33:32.849 --> 00:33:34.092
No, my dad too

637
00:33:34.159 --> 00:33:35.362
Are you Inverted Father?

638
00:33:35.429 --> 00:33:37.629
A man likes his older sister

639
00:33:37.696 --> 00:33:38.530
Hey Baek Soobin

640
00:33:38.597 --> 00:33:41.300
(Soobin) No, he’s young and tall.
A man who drives a nice car

641
00:33:41.367 --> 00:33:42.700
Ah, what do you like, sister?

642
00:33:42.767 --> 00:33:43.834
[Soobin’s laughter]
[Slightly stirring sound effect]

643
00:33:43.901 --> 00:33:45.647
[train horn sound effect]

644
00:33:45.714 --> 00:33:46.839
- No...
- (Edited) Ah!

645
00:33:48.776 --> 00:33:50.434
stop fussing

646
00:33:50.501 --> 00:33:52.411
If you don't want to break your head

647
00:33:53.881 --> 00:33:54.914
(Soobin) Uh...

648
00:33:56.758 --> 00:33:57.817
(Edited) Put the cup away!

649
00:33:59.086 --> 00:34:00.252
Look look
[Sound of door opening]

650
00:34:00.753 --> 00:34:02.957
How can you have other thoughts like that, Dad?
[Sound of door closing]

651
00:34:03.024 --> 00:34:06.225
Hey, somewhere else
Couldn’t it be a little different?

652
00:34:07.897 --> 00:34:09.094
I guess not?

653
00:34:11.566 --> 00:34:13.534
(In-kyung) Today, Director
You have an external schedule

654
00:34:13.601 --> 00:34:15.169
I will do it for you

655
00:34:16.537 --> 00:34:19.406
From the list of food hall stores

656
00:34:19.473 --> 00:34:22.676
Strong Ranch is gone
Happy milk was included.

657
00:34:23.412 --> 00:34:25.310
Is this something that was changed by the sales team?

658
00:34:25.377 --> 00:34:26.233
yes

659
00:34:26.300 --> 00:34:29.315
I think a contract with Strong Ranch is impossible.
I changed it

660
00:34:29.984 --> 00:34:31.685
You can't miss that place.

661
00:34:31.752 --> 00:34:33.588
Recently, it got a lot of attention by word of mouth.

662
00:34:33.655 --> 00:34:36.788
Any other department store
It's a brand that doesn't deliver.

663
00:34:36.855 --> 00:34:39.458
(Edited) To differentiate the food hall
It is a must to enter the store

664
00:34:39.525 --> 00:34:40.793
(Hyeju) Who doesn’t know that?

665
00:34:41.562 --> 00:34:42.962
I tried to persuade you

666
00:34:43.965 --> 00:34:47.067
Even if you give me 10 billion
It is not possible to enter department stores.

667
00:34:47.134 --> 00:34:48.501
Is that the company policy?

668
00:34:49.470 --> 00:34:50.738
Ah, I need a little more persuasion...

669
00:34:50.805 --> 00:34:51.939
(Hyeju) Easier said than done

670
00:34:52.573 --> 00:34:54.175
What is the sales team just doing?

671
00:34:54.742 --> 00:34:57.686
A company that doesn't even sit at the negotiating table at all
How can I persuade you?

672
00:34:59.097 --> 00:35:01.266
if you can
Would you like Team Leader Baek Soo-jeong to try it?

673
00:35:02.601 --> 00:35:04.601
[Meaningful music]

674
00:35:06.906 --> 00:35:10.075
Happy Milk too
It is a sufficiently competitive brand.

675
00:35:11.893 --> 00:35:13.268
Okay

676
00:35:13.335 --> 00:35:15.629
Because reality is also important.

677
00:35:15.696 --> 00:35:18.466
(In-kyung) To the head of the department:
I will report it like this.

678
00:35:19.091 --> 00:35:20.199
Okay then next

679
00:35:36.258 --> 00:35:38.295
Are you really planning on going in person?

680
00:35:38.362 --> 00:35:41.122
Oh, you never know.
Tomorrow is the weekend too

681
00:35:42.130 --> 00:35:44.225
Okay, good luck.

682
00:35:44.292 --> 00:35:45.351
(Sujeong) [Laughing] Yes

683
00:35:48.863 --> 00:35:50.863
[Exciting music]

684
00:36:00.673 --> 00:36:03.744
[Applause from caddies and executives]

685
00:36:06.514 --> 00:36:07.813
(Executives) Good shot, good shot

686
00:36:20.428 --> 00:36:21.727
(Executive 1) Oh, thank you for your hard work.

687
00:36:22.367 --> 00:36:24.398
- (Executive 2) Thank you for your hard work.
- (In-kyung) Thank you for your hard work.

688
00:36:24.465 --> 00:36:26.632
Why do you play golf like that?
I don't know if I like it

689
00:36:27.201 --> 00:36:29.370
If it weren't for the chairman
I wouldn't have come to a place like this.

690
00:36:29.437 --> 00:36:30.803
Aside from that...

691
00:36:32.167 --> 00:36:34.376
[Fanfare sound effect]
Congratulations on the hole in one

692
00:36:35.376 --> 00:36:37.209
What should I do, I'm the accompanist

693
00:36:37.687 --> 00:36:38.989
(Juyeon) I can’t do what I can’t do

694
00:36:40.681 --> 00:36:44.759
Ah, from the list you sent me yesterday
Why was Strong Ranch missing?

695
00:36:44.826 --> 00:36:46.654
This is a decision made by the sales team.

696
00:36:46.721 --> 00:36:49.623
Kanghan Ranch opens in a department store
I don't even consider it.

697
00:36:49.690 --> 00:36:52.793
So, at our department store
It will have a huge impact when it opens.

698
00:36:52.860 --> 00:36:54.695
(Juyeon) Tell me to try to persuade you somehow.

699
00:36:54.762 --> 00:36:56.163
Because there is still time

700
00:36:56.230 --> 00:36:59.641
(In-kyung) Anyway, today, Team Leader Baek Soo-jeong
I went to persuade him in person.

701
00:37:00.535 --> 00:37:01.500
Alone?

702
00:37:01.969 --> 00:37:03.704
I can't guarantee the results though

703
00:37:05.973 --> 00:37:07.070
It will be resolved soon.

704
00:37:13.779 --> 00:37:15.516
[lively music]

705
00:37:15.583 --> 00:37:16.615
[light laughter]

706
00:37:43.110 --> 00:37:45.077
[Sound of bus door opening]
[Card recognition sound]

707
00:38:05.700 --> 00:38:08.469
(Sujeong) Ah, I’ll listen as far as I can.
[Sound of bus door closing]

708
00:38:08.536 --> 00:38:10.571
No, no, this is heavy.

709
00:38:10.638 --> 00:38:12.537
Do I have to go to the ranch up there?

710
00:38:12.604 --> 00:38:14.673
Oh, it's heavy, so I'll lift it for you.

711
00:38:14.740 --> 00:38:15.650
(CEO Ahn) [Laughing] Oh my

712
00:38:15.717 --> 00:38:18.112
The young woman is also kind.

713
00:38:18.179 --> 00:38:19.113
thank you

714
00:38:19.180 --> 00:38:22.185
But this far away
Why did you come alone?

715
00:38:22.717 --> 00:38:25.584
Ah, I came to the ranch, Strong Ranch.

716
00:38:26.288 --> 00:38:29.457
[CEO Ahn’s puzzled groan]
(Edited) The ice cream here is really delicious.

717
00:38:29.524 --> 00:38:33.594
But they only sell it here
I came here once to see the ranch.

718
00:38:33.661 --> 00:38:35.930
Oh my, I have a lot of time.

719
00:38:35.997 --> 00:38:37.832
No, what kind of ice cream should I get?

720
00:38:37.899 --> 00:38:39.099
Did you come this far?

721
00:38:39.166 --> 00:38:40.634
Oh, I see.

722
00:38:40.701 --> 00:38:42.169
So that people can eat easily

723
00:38:42.236 --> 00:38:44.837
Somewhere like a department store
It would be great to open a store.

724
00:38:45.506 --> 00:38:48.409
(Edited) Why, what’s delicious?
They say the more you share, the better it tastes.

725
00:38:48.476 --> 00:38:49.534
[light laughter]

726
00:38:49.601 --> 00:38:50.576
(CEO Ahn) Huh?

727
00:38:51.300 --> 00:38:53.681
[Interesting music]

728
00:38:53.748 --> 00:38:55.114
Why, why are you like that?

729
00:38:58.486 --> 00:38:59.353
Give it to me

730
00:38:59.420 --> 00:39:01.522
(Representative Ahn) That bag
Give me this, give me, give me this

731
00:39:02.254 --> 00:39:05.023
(Edited) I guess you noticed, CEO.

732
00:39:11.667 --> 00:39:13.341
(Representative Ahn) Oh
[CEO Ahn’s light smile]

733
00:39:13.408 --> 00:39:14.535
Which company is it from?

734
00:39:14.602 --> 00:39:17.101
Is it Kayu or Yongseong?

735
00:39:17.168 --> 00:39:19.807
Yongseong Department Store
I came from the planning team.

736
00:39:19.874 --> 00:39:22.250
It's called Baeksujeong.
Thank you very much

737
00:39:22.317 --> 00:39:23.952
No, I don't have anything to ask for.

738
00:39:24.019 --> 00:39:27.148
Something like Yongseong
Do you know how to sell our products?

739
00:39:27.215 --> 00:39:28.676
(CEO Ahn) What I hate the most is

740
00:39:28.743 --> 00:39:31.051
He's a tycoon who gets rich from his own belly, huh?

741
00:39:31.118 --> 00:39:32.386
that tycoon

742
00:39:32.453 --> 00:39:34.586
Ah, so here's our suggestion...

743
00:39:37.501 --> 00:39:38.801
[Sound of car door opening]

744
00:39:38.868 --> 00:39:41.148
[Exciting music]

745
00:39:57.678 --> 00:39:59.912
Is this Representative Ahn?

746
00:40:00.834 --> 00:40:01.901
(CEO Ahn) Uh...

747
00:40:01.968 --> 00:40:03.284
What is this again?

748
00:40:03.351 --> 00:40:04.284
[CEO Ahn’s light smile]

749
00:40:04.351 --> 00:40:08.389
Oh, look at your outfit.
I don't think you're just an ordinary employee, right?

750
00:40:08.456 --> 00:40:10.458
[Laughing] Of course, after Yongseong...

751
00:40:10.525 --> 00:40:12.391
I grew up under the support of Yongseong.

752
00:40:14.033 --> 00:40:15.160
[Squeaking sound effect]

753
00:40:16.194 --> 00:40:17.700
This is my younger brother

754
00:40:17.767 --> 00:40:19.240
[humorous music]

755
00:40:19.307 --> 00:40:20.365
This master?

756
00:40:20.968 --> 00:40:22.036
[Sujeong’s awkward laughter]

757
00:40:22.103 --> 00:40:24.437
(Edited) You misunderstood because of the car and clothes.
[Sujeong’s shy smile]

758
00:40:25.306 --> 00:40:27.408
His job is a driver.

759
00:40:27.475 --> 00:40:30.042
These are all other people’s cars and other people’s clothes.

760
00:40:30.745 --> 00:40:33.712
They said it was nearby
Did you come all the way here to see your sister?

761
00:40:33.779 --> 00:40:35.082
[Sujeong’s awkward laughter]

762
00:40:35.149 --> 00:40:36.984
That's good, CEO.

763
00:40:37.051 --> 00:40:38.352
I'll give you a ride to the ranch.

764
00:40:38.419 --> 00:40:40.588
- Get in.
- (CEO Ahn) No, give me this baggage.

765
