(Edited) This...

1016
00:51:47.106 --> 00:51:49.374
Are you developing a new product?

1017
00:51:49.441 --> 00:51:50.424
Can I try it?

1018
00:51:50.491 --> 00:51:52.326
(CEO Ahn) Oh, whatever.

1019
00:52:02.036 --> 00:52:03.003
(Edited) Huh?

1020
00:52:04.505 --> 00:52:05.439
what's this?

1021
00:52:06.191 --> 00:52:07.308
Is this yogurt?

1022
00:52:07.375 --> 00:52:09.277
This will be a big hit when it's released

1023
00:52:09.828 --> 00:52:10.867
Hey, do you want to drink it too?

1024
00:52:10.934 --> 00:52:12.698
[Sound of pouring drinks]

1025
00:52:12.765 --> 00:52:14.045
Now

1026
00:52:15.082 --> 00:52:16.383
Drink it all the time, drink it all the time

1027
00:52:17.069 --> 00:52:19.037
Try the new product from Kanghan Ranch

1028
00:52:19.104 --> 00:52:21.019
You should feel very honored.

1029
00:52:25.578 --> 00:52:26.767
It's alcohol

1030
00:52:26.834 --> 00:52:30.264
[light music]
(CEO Ahn) Yes, that’s the makgeolli I made.

1031
00:52:30.331 --> 00:52:31.683
Go to the mineral spring up there

1032
00:52:31.750 --> 00:52:34.119
I made it by drawing water myself.

1033
00:52:34.186 --> 00:52:35.233
It tastes good, right?

1034
00:52:38.706 --> 00:52:39.737
It seems stupid

1035
00:52:40.308 --> 00:52:41.176
Bar...

1036
00:52:41.760 --> 00:52:43.744
What an idiot, this is rude to my sister.

1037
00:52:43.811 --> 00:52:45.230
(Juyeon) Is it time to shout out loud?

1038
00:52:45.297 --> 00:52:47.466
How are you going to get home, sister?

1039
00:52:48.033 --> 00:52:49.450
[Interesting music]

1040
00:52:49.517 --> 00:52:52.267
No, just as it came.
Just take the bus

1041
00:52:52.334 --> 00:52:53.338
(Representative Ahn) Um...

1042
00:52:53.405 --> 00:52:55.289
If you were going to go, you should have gone a long time ago.

1043
00:52:55.356 --> 00:52:56.654
All the buses were cut off

1044
00:52:58.693 --> 00:53:00.024
I guess I should call the driver.

1045
00:53:01.529 --> 00:53:04.729
(CEO Ahn) Article?
No, you're not the driver?

1046
00:53:05.351 --> 00:53:07.768
Oh, I meant the substitute driver.

1047
00:53:07.835 --> 00:53:10.571
(Representative Ahn) Representation from here to Seoul?

1048
00:53:12.173 --> 00:53:13.300
Can't you?

1049
00:53:13.367 --> 00:53:15.607
[CEO Ahn clicks his tongue]

1050
00:53:16.244 --> 00:53:19.565
Oh my, I live under a father who runs a hardware store.

1051
00:53:19.632 --> 00:53:21.533
Taking care of my sick mother

1052
00:53:21.600 --> 00:53:23.268
Pay off all your debt, okay?

1053
00:53:23.335 --> 00:53:26.584
(CEO Ahn) I was trying to repay the house loan.
Didn't you say you were having a hard time?

1054
00:53:27.221 --> 00:53:31.400
But do you think your younger brother has suffered less?

1055
00:53:31.467 --> 00:53:32.893
[Embarrassed laughter]

1056
00:53:32.960 --> 00:53:34.959
You pretended not to listen to me

1057
00:53:36.567 --> 00:53:40.319
Well, it's because he's still young.

1058
00:53:40.386 --> 00:53:42.102
(Edited) He’s 5 years younger than me.

1059
00:53:42.169 --> 00:53:44.205
Well, compared to me, he's a complete kid.

1060
00:53:44.272 --> 00:53:45.333
- (Representative Ahn) Huh?
- (Edited) Well, um

1061
00:53:45.400 --> 00:53:47.204
- Kid?
- (Edited) Write!

1062
00:53:47.271 --> 00:53:49.127
How much is the agency fee from here to Seoul?

1063
00:53:49.194 --> 00:53:51.064
Why don't you throw some money on the street?

1064
00:53:51.131 --> 00:53:52.671
No, then what are you going to do?

1065
00:53:53.165 --> 00:53:54.112
older sister

1066
00:53:55.767 --> 00:53:57.618
Well... what should I do?

1067
00:53:57.685 --> 00:53:59.454
(Representative Ahn) What should I do?

1068
00:54:00.021 --> 00:54:01.256
I should go to sleep

1069
00:54:06.139 --> 00:54:08.139
[Grass bugs and howling all night long]

1070
00:54:14.001 --> 00:54:16.668
(Edited) The potatoes were cooked very well.
Director

1071
00:54:18.306 --> 00:54:19.771
Don’t you treat me like your younger brother anymore?

1072
00:54:20.325 --> 00:54:22.304
why? Do you want to call me sister again?

1073
00:54:23.477 --> 00:54:25.812
(Sujeong) It suits you so well
I thought he was really my younger brother

1074
00:54:29.201 --> 00:54:31.803
Ah, I'm sorry it happened like this.

1075
00:54:31.870 --> 00:54:33.205
So just go

1076
00:54:33.701 --> 00:54:34.686
[laughter]

1077
00:54:35.741 --> 00:54:36.721
Is that an apple?

1078
00:54:39.011 --> 00:54:41.480
Sweeten it to the general manager’s taste.
It would be perfect, right?

1079
00:54:42.096 --> 00:54:44.096
[Sound of pouring makgeolli]

1080
00:54:44.706 --> 00:54:47.165
(Edited) I came here to take a day off today.
Will you think about it?

1081
00:54:48.436 --> 00:54:51.072
The air is nice and the stars are pretty.

1082
00:54:58.564 --> 00:55:00.065
It was just something I said.

1083
00:55:01.100 --> 00:55:03.502
Because I'm doing this
I feel like I'm really resting.

1084
00:55:05.686 --> 00:55:07.755
I couldn't even go on vacation this year because I was working.

1085
00:55:10.075 --> 00:55:11.243
Why are you working so hard?

1086
00:55:12.611 --> 00:55:13.591
whatever

1087
00:55:15.730 --> 00:55:17.416
[Calm music]

1088
00:55:17.483 --> 00:55:18.629
When I was young

1089
00:55:20.168 --> 00:55:22.467
Hanging upside down on an iron bar
Because you liked it?

1090
00:55:22.996 --> 00:55:24.138
But a passing man

1091
00:55:24.205 --> 00:55:26.641
Girls play rough like that
It's not possible.

1092
00:55:27.226 --> 00:55:30.162
(Edited) With a young heart
That's so annoying and ridiculous

1093
00:55:30.229 --> 00:55:31.964
I played harder like that.

1094
00:55:33.999 --> 00:55:35.834
Another day I went to school

1095
00:55:35.901 --> 00:55:38.437
The teacher wants me to give up being class president.

1096
00:55:38.504 --> 00:55:40.972
Because my mom doesn't care
I don't think it will work

1097
00:55:41.039 --> 00:55:42.253
Where is that?

1098
00:55:42.908 --> 00:55:44.509
The class president's job is his own.

1099
00:55:44.576 --> 00:55:45.744
So

1100
00:55:46.445 --> 00:55:48.996
As they wish
Determine my limits

1101
00:55:49.063 --> 00:55:51.462
I hate being judged.

1102
00:55:52.533 --> 00:55:54.098
So if you say no

1103
00:55:54.920 --> 00:55:56.355
I worked harder

1104
00:55:56.855 --> 00:55:57.923
tenaciously

1105
00:55:59.974 --> 00:56:03.077
(Edited) That I can do it
Feeling like I want to be recognized

1106
00:56:03.695 --> 00:56:04.709
Do you know what it is?

1107
00:56:08.233 --> 00:56:09.134
I know

1108
00:56:10.169 --> 00:56:12.583
To whom exactly
It's not something that needs to be acknowledged, but

1109
00:56:14.773 --> 00:56:16.375
I guess it's just personality

1110
00:56:17.543 --> 00:56:19.845
(Sujeong) I want to be good at everything

1111
00:56:19.912 --> 00:56:21.947
I can't stand being ignored

1112
00:56:22.881 --> 00:56:23.928
that kind of personality

1113
00:56:24.498 --> 00:56:26.498
[Calm music - continued]

1114
00:56:31.402 --> 00:56:32.403
[Embarrassed laughter]

1115
00:56:35.810 --> 00:56:36.808
Me too

1116
00:56:38.746 --> 00:56:40.081
(Juyeon) I want to be recognized

1117
00:56:41.282 --> 00:56:42.416
I want to do well

1118
00:56:43.885 --> 00:56:46.217
I can't stand being ignored

1119
00:56:48.519 --> 00:56:49.657
[Laughs slightly]

1120
00:56:52.044 --> 00:56:53.024
Why are you smiling?

1121
00:56:56.497 --> 00:56:57.995
(Edited) The head of the department and I

1122
00:56:58.633 --> 00:57:00.735
I thought it looked similar

1123
00:57:01.802 --> 00:57:03.634
It's funny, it doesn't make sense.

1124
00:57:07.860 --> 00:57:09.194
Nothing makes sense

1125
00:57:10.262 --> 00:57:11.642
(Juyeon) Because there is another similarity

1126
00:57:13.866 --> 00:57:14.800
first love

1127
00:57:20.138 --> 00:57:21.118
To me too

1128
00:57:21.801 --> 00:57:24.033
twice again
This is someone I don't want to meet.

1129
00:57:26.027 --> 00:57:27.194
If that person

1130
00:57:28.996 --> 00:57:31.495
Me as I am
I thought he would admit it

1131
00:57:33.685 --> 00:57:34.765
It was the worst

1132
00:57:39.124 --> 00:57:41.739
Between comrades who had the worst first love

1133
00:57:42.343 --> 00:57:43.474
Should I salt it?

1134
00:57:46.852 --> 00:57:48.012
(Edited) Salty
[Sound of clinking glasses]

1135
00:57:49.513 --> 00:57:51.513
[bright music]

1136
00:58:49.067 --> 00:58:50.541
[cell phone vibrating sound]

1137
00:58:55.834 --> 00:58:56.914
Wait a minute

1138
00:59:01.840 --> 00:59:02.887
(Sujeong) Uh, sister

1139
00:59:03.709 --> 00:59:05.890
I'm on a business trip to Gangwon-do, with the head of the department.

1140
00:59:07.324 --> 00:59:08.796
Hey, what is a man

1141
00:59:08.863 --> 00:59:11.733
I heard you’re the same age as Soobin Baek.
Will I look like a man?

1142
00:59:12.434 --> 00:59:14.434
[light music]

1143
00:59:21.460 --> 00:59:25.196
(Hajin) Still, with the head of the department
Aren't we being too friendly?

1144
00:59:25.263 --> 00:59:26.624
So why not?

1145
00:59:26.691 --> 00:59:28.182
It’s better than the general manager killer.

1146
00:59:28.249 --> 00:59:29.617
(Hajin) No, I

1147
00:59:29.684 --> 00:59:32.453
Even if the truth is uncomfortable for you
I'm afraid you'll find out

1148
00:59:33.321 --> 00:59:34.989
An inconvenient truth?

1149
00:59:35.056 --> 00:59:36.657
Well, that...

1150
00:59:37.309 --> 00:59:38.543
Are you a chaebol?

1151
00:59:38.610 --> 00:59:41.513
(Hajin) What if there is corruption or something like that?
Can you put up with your personality?

1152
00:59:41.580 --> 00:59:43.700
Then things really get bigger, you

1153
00:59:43.767 --> 00:59:45.984
Write, sister, are you bored?

1154
00:59:46.051 --> 00:59:48.065
Are you paying too much attention to not fitting in?

1155
00:59:48.132 --> 00:59:49.988
[Sighing] I don’t know.

1156
00:59:50.055 --> 00:59:51.256
you said clearly

1157
00:59:51.323 --> 00:59:53.307
I don’t feel like the head of the department is a man.

1158
00:59:53.374 --> 00:59:54.238
(Edited) Huh?

1159
00:59:55.961 --> 00:59:56.874
uh

1160
00:59:57.812 --> 00:59:59.613
Okay, good work.

1161
01:00:03.301 --> 01:00:04.515
Why is this sister like this?

1162
01:00:06.312 --> 01:00:07.451
It's strange

1163
01:00:28.693 --> 01:00:29.673
(Edited) Are you sleeping?

1164
01:00:32.064 --> 01:00:33.899
If I drink alcohol, I fall asleep.

1165
01:00:35.033 --> 01:00:36.902
Director, go in and sleep.

1166
01:00:37.836 --> 01:00:38.737
Yes?

1167
01:00:39.971 --> 01:00:40.872
Director

1168
01:00:46.300 --> 01:00:48.300
[Calm music]

1169
01:00:51.750 --> 01:00:52.897
offended

1170
01:00:54.886 --> 01:00:56.354
No, I...

1171
01:00:56.421 --> 01:00:57.501
To wake you up

1172
01:01:00.341 --> 01:01:02.076
Why do you keep ignoring people?

1173
01:01:03.762 --> 01:01:04.729
When am I?

1174
01:01:20.534 --> 01:01:22.534
[Calm music]

1175
01:01:41.433 --> 01:01:42.450
Even if this happens

1176
01:01:42.517 --> 01:01:44.181
[Sound of grass bugs crying]

1177
01:01:50.642 --> 01:01:51.843
Doesn't he look like a man?

1178
01:01:53.767 --> 01:01:55.767
[Exciting music]

1179
01:02:55.890 --> 01:02:58.345
{\an8}[Music: ‘He’s a Black Flame Dragon’ OST]

1180
01:03:24.467 --> 01:03:27.150
{\an8}(Edited) Namjoo’s psychology
I just can't understand it

1181
01:03:27.217 --> 01:03:29.687
{\an8}(Juyeon) Shall we work together as comrades?

1182
01:03:30.688 --> 01:03:33.667
{\an8}It happened last night
Are you just going to move on like this?

1183
01:03:33.734 --> 01:03:35.600
{\an8}(Juyeon) Let’s just overlook that kind of mistake.

1184
01:03:35.667 --> 01:03:38.495
{\an8}(Edited) Crazy, such a mistake
Should I just move on?

1185
01:03:38.562 --> 01:03:39.997
{\an8}Are you on a blind date?

1186
01:03:40.064 --> 01:03:40.868
{\an8}(Juyeon) Is it real?

1187
01:03:40.935 --> 01:03:42.200
{\an8}(Edited) Why are you curious about that?

1188
01:03:42.267 --> 01:03:43.434
{\an8}(Jihoo) Sujeong!

1189
01:03:43.501 --> 01:03:45.634
{\an8}(Edit) I was worried because they said I was going on a blind date.

1190
01:03:45.701 --> 01:03:47.071
{\an8}(Juyeon) I don’t care
[People cheering]

1191
01:03:47.601 --> 01:03:48.606
{\an8}Why me?

1192
01:03:49.177 --> 01:03:50.978
{\an8}Why don't I look like a man?

